  breaks takes priority: wrappable code exceeding 120 columns will also wrap, a known
  difference from IDEA defaults (DO_NOT_WRAP / WRAP_LONG_LINES=false).
  Alignment values: 16 = WRAP_COMPACT + INDENT_DEFAULT; 18 = WRAP_COMPACT + INDENT_ON_COLUMN.
